{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24396","headline":"小岁日喜谈氏外孙女孩满月 · 白居易","name":"小岁日喜谈氏外孙女孩满月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今旦夫妻喜，他人岂得知。\n自嗟生女晚，敢讶见孙迟。\n物以稀爲贵，情因老更慈。\n新年逢吉日，满月乞名时。\n桂燎熏花果，兰汤洗玉肌。\n怀中有可抱，何必是男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}